NAME	KIND	SUMMARY
app	spec	AppSpec: desired state of a long-running deployable unit (an app is one or more processes).
app.created	event	An app was created.
app.deleted	event	An app was deleted (teardown per ADR-0023).
app.teardown_aborted	event	An app delete was aborted after teardown because a deployment was admitted mid-delete; the in-flight deployment rebuilds the carriers (ADR-0023).
build.building	event	Build started executing.
build.cancelled	event	Build cancelled.
build.expired	event	Build expired by timeout watchdog.
build.failed	event	Build failed.
build.queued	event	Build accepted into build queue.
build.succeeded	event	Build produced an image digest.
config.updated	event	A config version was written.
database	spec	DatabaseSpec: desired state of a managed data service (template-rendered, rides the Runtime channel).
deployment.building	event	Deployment entered build stage.
deployment.cancelled	event	Deployment cancelled while queued or in flight.
deployment.failed	event	Deployment reached failed terminal state.
deployment.observing	event	Deployment entered health observation window.
deployment.preparing	event	Deployment started preparing spec and materials.
deployment.queued	event	Deployment accepted by admission queue.
deployment.releasing	event	Deployment started releasing workloads to runtime.
deployment.rolling_back	event	Deployment started replaying last successful revision.
deployment.succeeded	event	Deployment reached succeeded terminal state.
deployment.superseded	event	Deployment superseded by a newer one.
hook.push_accepted	event	A verified webhook push triggered a deployment.
invitation.accepted	event	An invitation was redeemed; the invitee became a user.
invitation.created	event	An invitation was issued (single-use, time-boxed, role-bound).
network.created	event	A project network was created.
node.joined	event	Node joined the cluster and was anchored with a platform node ID.
node.left	event	Node left the cluster.
project.created	event	A project was created.
project.deleted	event	A project was deleted (tombstoned).
role.created	event	A custom role was created from a scope set.
secret.deleted	event	A secret was deleted.
secret.updated	event	A secret value was set (fingerprint, never the value).
task	spec	TaskSpec: desired state of a programmatic workload (one-shot or resident, ADR-0012).
team.created	event	A team was created.
token.created	event	A token was minted (secret shown once at creation).
token.revoked	event	A token was revoked; its next call will be rejected.
user.created	event	A user was created and granted a role in a team.
volume.created	event	A volume was created.
workload.drift_detected	event	Observed workload diverged from the ensured generation or spec (ADR-0022).
workload.stopped	event	A steady-state workload was observed stopped at the current generation.
run 'fleetly explain <name>' for the full JSON Schema
